What is a Data Source in Terraform?
Data sources allow you to fetch data from existing infrastructure managed outside your Terraform code.

   In data.tf
  data "aws_ami" "ami_id" {

  most_recent = true
  owners = ["973714476881"]

  filter {
    name  = "name"
    values = ["RHEL-9-DevOps-Practice"]
  }
}

Now you can use this in other parts of your code:

ami_id = data.aws_ami.ami_id.id

📤 What is an Output in Terraform?
Outputs let you display values after applying the plan.

output.tf

  output "ami_id" {
  value = data.aws_ami.ami_id.id
}

When you run terraform apply, you’ll see:
vpc_id = vpc-0a12bc34d56ef78gh
